+++ b/tests/source/batches/BATCH-CONTRACT-0001/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# BATCH-CONTRACT-0001 source probe
+
+`contract_probe.test.ts` is the pre-migration contract probe for the TypeScript
+6.0.3 implementation of `ncipollo/release-action`. It drives the `src/` entry
+points directly (inputs, outputs, releases REST mapping, action orchestration,
+artifact globbing/validation and GitHub error formatting) and asserts the
+normalized contract value for every CONTRACT observation owned by this batch.
+
+The probe is a vitest test. The INTEGRATION runner copies it into the source
+repository's `__tests__/` directory (so its `../src/*.js` imports resolve) and
+runs it with an explicit timeout, for example:
+
+```
+timeout 600 pnpm install --prefer-offline
+timeout 600 pnpm exec vitest run __tests__/contract_probe.test.ts
+```
+
+`@actions/core` is replaced by the repository's manual mock, so no credentials,
+network access or GitHub API calls occur. The probe itself never blocks and
+performs no privileged work; the enclosing `timeout` is still required by the
+harness rules.
+
+The same 31 normalized values are produced by
+`target/batches/BATCH-CONTRACT-0001/contract_probe_test.go`, and comparing the
+two sides after normalization is the contract assertion for this batch.
