+
+The probe executes the packaged Node entry point, `dist/index.js`, with the
+corpus-provided environment and mock GitHub responses. When Node.js or the
+bundle is unavailable the probe records `status: unavailable` and never claims a
+PASS observation; the differential verdict is only valid once the source probe
+has really executed. Each case subprocess is bounded by an explicit 60 second
+timeout.
+
+```
+python3 source/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001/probe.py /path/to/report.json
+```
