+# BATCH-F2P-0001 source probe
+
+`probe.sh` runs the shared fail-to-pass predicates
+(`shared/batches/BATCH-F2P-0001/f2p_checks.py`) against the pre-migration
+TypeScript tree at `/input/source` by default.
+
+The observed pre-migration status is `FAIL` for every F2P observation because
+the required Go execution path (Docker entry point, Go build, Go module policy,
+Go behavioural tests, Go test workflow) does not exist in the source
+technology.  The wrapper does not assert that outcome; it is whatever the
+shared predicate observes.
+
+Usage:
+
+```sh
+timeout 600 source/batches/BATCH-F2P-0001/probe.sh /input/source /logs/source-result.json
+```
+
+This directory is not a harness entry point: `source/runner` is created only by
+the INTEGRATION batch.
